                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>For texts of an address by President Truman before the Canadian Parliament in
                    Ottawa, June 11, and of a special news conference with Prime Minister Mackenzie
                    King near Ottawa, June 12, see <hi rendition="#italic">Public Papers of the
                        Presidents of the United States: Harry S. Truman, 1947</hi> (Washington,
                    Government Printing Office, 1963), pages 272–277.</p>
            </div>
